{"level":30,"time":1778246210670,"pid":122,"hostname":"4de9b0d3-b46","step":"review-runs","item":"1.md","index":9,"runIndex":"run-3","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_013s3rsRNCTQKVJBc92a9br3","type":"tool_result","content":"     1→# Site Plan: Valley View Townhomes\n     2→\n     3→**Site Address:** N/A\n     4→**Site Plan Number:** N/A\n     5→**Zoning:** N/A\n     6→\n     7→## Primary Site Plan (39 sheets)\n     8→\n     9→**Document ID (for vision tool):** `1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777`\n    10→\n    11→### Sheet Index\n    12→\n    13→- **Sheet 1 [Cover]:** Cover sheet containing project details, location map, and sheet index. → `primary-site-plan/sheet-01/guide.md`\n    14→- **Sheet 2 [Plat]:** Subdivision plat map showing legal boundaries, easements, and signatures. → `primary-site-plan/sheet-02/guide.md`\n    15→- **Sheet 3 [General Notes]:** Comprehensive general notes, sequence of construction, and project legend. → `primary-site-plan/sheet-03/guide.md`\n    16→- **Sheet 4 [Existing Conditions Survey]:** Topographic survey detailing existing structures, trees, and property boundaries. → `primary-site-plan/sheet-04/guide.md`\n    17→- **Sheet 5 [Erosion and Sedimentation Control Plan]:** Site layout detailing erosion and sedimentation control measures. → `primary-site-plan/sheet-05/guide.md`\n    18→- **Sheet 6 [Erosion Control Notes]:** Contains erosion control, tree protection, and special construction notes. → `primary-site-plan/sheet-06/guide.md`\n    19→- **Sheet 7 [Erosion Control Details]:** Standard details and specifications for erosion and sediment control. → `primary-site-plan/sheet-07/guide.md`\n    20→- **Sheet 8 [Tree Removal & Demolition Plan]:** Site plan detailing existing structure demolition and tree removal. → `primary-site-plan/sheet-08/guide.md`\n    21→- **Sheet 9 [Site Plan]:** Detailed site plan layout with associated building and parking data. → `primary-site-plan/sheet-09/guide.md`\n    22→- **Sheet 10 [Fire Protection Plan]:** Site plan illustrating fire lanes, hydrants, and fire zone details. → `primary-site-plan/sheet-10/guide.md`\n    23→- **Sheet 11 [Grading Plan]:** This sheet displays the detailed grading plan for the development site. → `primary-site-plan/sheet-11/guide.md`\n    24→- **Sheet 12 [Storm Sewer Plan]:** Displays the proposed storm sewer layout and drainage infrastructure details. → `primary-site-plan/sheet-12/guide.md`\n    25→- **Sheet 13 [Drainage Area Map]:** Existing and proposed drainage area maps with summary tables. → `primary-site-plan/sheet-13/guide.md`\n    26→- **Sheet 14 [Inlet Drainage Area Map]:** Site drainage area map and rational method runoff calculations. → `primary-site-plan/sheet-14/guide.md`\n    27→- **Sheet 15 [Biofiltration-Detention Pond Plan & Calculations]:** Biofiltration and detention pond plan, details, and engineering calculations. → `primary-site-plan/sheet-15/guide.md`\n    28→- **Sheet 16 [Biofiltration-Detention Pond Profiles]:** Biofiltration pond profiles, outfall details, and comprehensive maintenance requirements. → `primary-site-plan/sheet-16/guide.md`\n    29→- **Sheet 17 [Conveyance Cross Sections]:** Conveyance cross-section graphs and corresponding site plan view. → `primary-site-plan/sheet-17/guide.md`\n    30→- **Sheet 18 [Austin Water General Information & Construction Notes]:** Austin Water general information, construction notes, and flow tests. → `primary-site-plan/sheet-18/guide.md`\n    31→- **Sheet 19 [Utility Tap Plan]:** Utility tap plan showing proposed water and wastewater connections. → `primary-site-plan/sheet-19/guide.md`\n    32→- **Sheet 20 [Utility Tap Public Plan & Profile]:** Utility tap public plan and profile for townhomes project. → `primary-site-plan/sheet-20/guide.md`\n    33→- **Sheet 21 [Preliminary Electrical Design Plan]:** Layout of preliminary electrical design, routing, transformers, and meters. → `primary-site-plan/sheet-21/guide.md`\n    34→- **Sheet 22 [Construction Details 1]:** Construction details for curbs, sidewalks, driveways, and bicycle parking. → `primary-site-plan/sheet-22/guide.md`\n    35→- **Sheet 23 [Construction Details 2]:** Standard construction details for water infrastructure, valves, and fire hydrants. → `primary-site-plan/sheet-23/guide.md`\n    36→- **Sheet 24 [Construction Details 3]:** Standard construction details for water services and trench repairs. → `primary-site-plan/sheet-24/guide.md`\n    37→- **Sheet 25 [Construction Details 4]:** Standard details, plan, and section views for fire line meters. → `primary-site-plan/sheet-25/guide.md`\n    38→- **Sheet 26 [Construction Details 5]:** Standard details for wastewater service connections and sewer cleanouts. → `primary-site-plan/sheet-26/guide.md`\n    39→- **Sheet 27 [Construction Details 6]:** Construction details for wastewater manholes and duplex grinder pumps. → `primary-site-plan/sheet-27/guide.md`\n    40→- **Sheet 28 [Construction Details 7]:** Construction details for storm drain manholes and catch basins. → `primary-site-plan/sheet-28/guide.md`\n    41→- **Sheet 29 [Addressing Plan]:** Site plan showing building layouts and individual unit addresses. → `primary-site-plan/sheet-29/guide.md`\n    42→- **Sheet 30 [Existing Tree Plan]:** Site plan displaying existing trees, protection measures, and care notes. → `primary-site-plan/sheet-30/guide.md`\n    43→- **Sheet 31 [Landscape Plan]:** Landscape design plan featuring planting details and irrigation notes. → `primary-site-plan/sheet-31/guide.md`\n    44→- **Sheet 32 [Tree List]:** This page provides a detailed list of surveyed trees. → `primary-site-plan/sheet-32/guide.md`\n    45→- **Sheet 33 [Canopy Impact Exhibit]:** Exhibits detailing tree canopy calculations and construction impact analysis. → `primary-site-plan/sheet-33/guide.md`\n    46→- **Sheet 34 [Root Zone Impact Exhibit]:** Critical root zone impact diagrams, calculations, and tree photos. → `primary-site-pl