ical clearances from driveways/parking to overhead lines\n6. Whether trees near overhead lines are utility-compatible species\n7. Whether fence, retaining wall, and other feature clearances from overhead lines are documented\n\nNow I need to use vision tools to actually inspect what the plans show for overhead electric facilities and their clearance dimensions. \n\nLet me start by examining Sheet 9 (Site Plan) and Sheet 31 (Landscape Plan) to see the actual depiction of overhead facilities.","signature":""}],"model":"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001","stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":0},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"eedc0646-e80c-4971-bf87-8e70b8767067","uuid":"8b480934-73ed-4c8f-bb4d-cd8f0f054601"}
