rmer pads:\n    *   **Near the top-left transformer pad (West of Bldg 1):** A **\"Wastewater Easement Doc #\"** (text partially unclear) is shown just north of the entrance drive, and a **\"Sidewalk Easement Doc #\"** is labeled further west along the property line.\n    *   **Near the middle-right transformer pad (East of Bldg 5):** Just north of this pad is a **\"25' Drainage Easement Doc. 2011021707 P.R.T.C.Tx.\"** and just to the south is a **\"15' Easement Vol. 73, Pg. 76 P.R.T.C.Tx.\"** running along the eastern boundary.\n    *   **Near the bottom-left transformer pad (West of Bldg 8):** As mentioned, the pad itself has a boundary labeled **\"Vault Easement\"**. Further west along the property line, the **\"Sidewalk Easement Doc #\"** continues."}]}
