{"level":30,"time":1778246418703,"pid":122,"hostname":"4de9b0d3-b46","step":"review-runs","item":"13.md","index":8,"runIndex":"run-3","type":"assistant","message":{"id":"gen_01KR3VXAMG37RAZ9B0KXSVMF60","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Based on my comprehensive research, I have reviewed the site plan thoroughly and examined Sheets 9, 10, 11, 19-22, 31, and supplementary documents. I found 5 transformer pads shown on Sheet 21 with NO supporting detail documentation or clearance dimensions.\n\n## RESEARCH SUMMARY — NOT FOUND / COULD NOT VERIFY:\n\n**Critical Missing Elements:**\n1. **Transformer Pad Detail Sheets** - NOT FOUND anywhere in plan set\n2. **Clearance Dimensions** - NO horizontal distances provided from any transformer to buildings, structures, utilities, or site features\n3. **Transformer Type Documentation** - NO specification of oil-filled vs. dry-type equipment\n4. **Service Type** - NO documentation of single-phase vs. three-phase service\n5. **Transformer Easements** - NOT shown on easement exhibits or site plan\n6. **Electrical Routing Documentation** - NO routing details from transformer to meters showing 100% private property location\n7. **Bollard Specifications** - NOT documented despite 5 pads in parking/vehicle areas\n8. **Drainage Direction Specifications** - NOT documented for transformer locations\n9. **Cross-Section Drawings** - NOT provided for vertical clearances in access paths\n10. **Austin Energy Design Approval Documents** - NOT included (ESPA, detail sheets, written approvals for clearance reductions)\n11. **Root Barrier Details** - NOT specified for any trees near transformers\n12. **Fire Escape Clearances** - NOT documented\n13. **Overhead Distribution Clearances** - NO verification of 7.5-foot or 15-foot radius clearances from overhead electric lines shown on plan\n\n**Potential Easement Conflicts:**\n- Facts.md indicates critical easements NOT depicted on site plan: Greenbelt easement (0.31 acres NE interior) and City drainage easement (0.130 acres NE corner). Transformer proximity to these easements not verified.\n- Facts.md cites 25-foot drainage easement and 7.5-foot PUE from Cortez Heights plat at NE boundary—impact on transformer locations not verified.\n\nNow I will evaluate each checklist item:"}],"model":"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001","stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":0},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"6bbc8513-4a76-42d1-91f8-a8d89a310ed5","uuid":"e0c6b5da-4f2a-432d-ab42-d4ded8a320cc"}
