{"level":30,"time":1778246431396,"pid":122,"hostname":"4de9b0d3-b46","step":"review-runs","item":"13.md","index":2,"runIndex":"run-1","type":"assistant","message":{"id":"gen_01KR3VX29A0ER26VGXXJGJ7NW3","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Now I'll analyze the research findings and evaluate each checklist item systematically.\n\n## RESEARCH SUMMARY\n\n**Transformer Pads Identified:**\n- Sheet 21 (Preliminary Electrical Design Plan) shows 5 distinct transformer pads labeled \"Electrical Transformer Pad\"\n- Locations identified: near Buildings 1, 2, 8, between Buildings 4-5, and between Buildings 6-7\n- All transformer pads appear to be on private property (within property boundary)\n\n**CRITICAL MISSING INFORMATION - NOT FOUND / COULD NOT VERIFY:**\n1. **No clearance dimensions** - No distance measurements from transformer pads to buildings, structures, utilities, or other site features\n2. **No access door orientations** - Access door directions not marked; critical for determining 10-foot vs 15-foot clearance zones\n3. **No transformer specifications** - Service type (single-phase vs three-phase), transformer type (oil-filled vs dry-type) not documented\n4. **No AE Design detail references** - No callouts to Austin Energy Design approved transformer pad detail sheets\n5. **No transformer easements shown** - Required easements not depicted on site plan\n6. **No bollard specifications** - Main 5 labeled transformer pads lack documented bollard details\n7. **No underground utility separation documentation** - Distances to water, wastewater, storm drain, and other utilities not documented\n8. **No vegetation utility-compatibility confirmation** - Landscape plan shows trees but does not identify species per ECM Appendix F utility-compatible standards\n9. **No drainage direction shown** - For potential oil-filled equipment, drainage direction not documented\n10. **Undocumented easements** - Facts.md indicates two critical easements (Greenbelt Access & Use and City of Austin Drainage) are recorded but NOT depicted on submitted site plan; transformer locations relative to these cannot be verified\n\n---\n\nNow I'll evaluate each checklist item:"}],"model":"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001","stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":0},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"1d23ed0d-287b-46bb-a723-f7b26bb1858c","uuid":"097ca4d4-d88c-43eb-8dcd-2b0a3b03768c"}
