ws showing surveyed conductor elevations and clearance dimensions from projections to the outside conductor, both the 7.5-foot sky-to-ground and 15-foot radial clearances cannot be verified.","tools_used":["vision","read"]},"codeCitations":["UCM § 1.10.3"],"applicableAreas":["Building projections (roofs, overhangs, canopies) on 8 proposed structures near overhead electric lines"],"sheetReferences":[{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNumber":9},{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNumber":21}],"documentReferences":[],"comment":"No building elevation sheets or section views are provided showing vertical clearances from building projections to overhead electric conductors. Clearance compliance cannot be verified."},{"deficiencyId":"EL-1.4","status":"n/a","agentTrace":{"observation":"Review of site plan sheets 9, 21, and 31 reveals no gas pump canopy locations proposed on the site plan. The project is a residential townhome development with no commercial fueling infrastructure.","reasoning":"Gas pump canopies are not proposed as part of this development, so the applicability condition (gas pump canopies present and overhead electric lines exist) is not met. The requirement does not apply.","tools_used":["read"]},"codeCitations":["UCM § 1.10.3"],"applicableAreas":[],"sheetReferences":[],"documentReferences":[],"comment":"No gas pump canopies proposed on site plan. Requirement not applicable to this residential project."},{"deficiencyId":"EL-1.5","status":"not-verifiable","agentTrace":{"observation":"Site plan shows pedestrian walkways and common open space areas labeled on Sheet 9 and 31, but no elevated walkways, elevated platforms, or stairs with structural supports that would require 15-foot radial clearance from overhead electric distribution facilities are explicitly identified. Documentation about whether these walkways are elevated structures or at-grade is insufficient.","reasoning":"If elevated walkways or platforms 