perimeter and pond area. Sheet 21 shows transformer pad locations. No dimension lines connect any transformer pad to any retaining wall to indicate distance.","reasoning":"Although retaining walls exist on site, the applicability condition is met. However, no measurements or callouts demonstrate the required 5-foot minimum clearance, making compliance verification impossible.","tools_used":["vision_check"]}},{"deficiencyId":"EL-13.3","status":"not-verifiable","codeCitations":["UCM § 1.10.4 Table 1.10.4"],"applicableAreas":["Transformer pad locations where fences may be adjacent"],"sheetReferences":[{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNumber":9},{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNumber":21}],"documentReferences":[],"comment":"Fences are indicated on site plan but the access door orientation of each transformer pad and clearance distances to fences are not documented, preventing verification of required clearances (5 feet for sides with operators/controls, 3 feet for sides without).","agentTrace":{"observation":"Site plan shows wooden privacy fences (H.6) marked along property boundaries. Sheet 21 shows transformer pads without labeled access door orientation or distances to fences.","reasoning":"Fence locations are confirmed, but without explicit documentation of which side of each transformer is the access door and measured distances to adjacent fences, compliance cannot be verified.","tools_used":["vision_check"]}},{"deficiencyId":"EL-13.4","status":"not-verifiable","codeCitations":["UCM § 1.10.4 Table 1.10.4 footnote 2"],"applicableAreas":["Any transformer pad location with less than 5-foot clearance to buildings"],"sheetReferences":[{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNumber":21}],"documentReferences":[],"comment":"No clearances less than 5 feet are documented on plans. If such clearances are proposed, required documentation of Austin Energy Design written approval, 3-hour fire rating, confined space analysis, and vertical clearances cannot be verified.","agentTrace":{"observation":"Sheet 21 shows transformer pads without clearance dimensions. No callouts or notes indicate clearances less than 5 feet to buildings.","reasoning":"The condition triggering this requirement (documented clearances <5 feet) is not evident from the plans. If such reduced clearances are intended, supporting documentation is absent. Status is not-verifiable pending applicant clarification.","tools_used":["vision_check"]}},{"deficiencyId":"EL-13.5","status":"not-verifiable","codeCitations":["UCM § 1.10.4 Table 1.10.4"],"applicableAreas":["Transformer pad locations where building overhangs or balconies are present"],"sheetReferences":[{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNumber":21}],"documentReferences":[],"comment":"No covering structures or buildings are depicted directly above transformer pads, and no lateral clearances from balconies/overhangs are documented. Building elevation details required to verify compliance cannot be assessed.","agentTrace":{"observation":"Sheet 21 shows transformer pads at grade level with no building elements indicated directly overhead. No building elevation sheets were reviewed that would show balcony or overhang details relative to transformer locations.","reasoning":"Without building elevation cross-sections showing the spatial relationship between transformer locations and building projections, compliance with the 5-foot lateral clearance requirement cannot be verified.","tools_used":[]}},{"deficiencyId":"EL-13.6","status":"not-verifiable","codeCitations":["UCM § 1.10.4 Table 1.10.4"],"applicableAreas":["Transformer pad locations near building windows, doors, or ventilating ducts"],"sheetReferences":[{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNumber":21}],"documentReferences":[],"comment":"No building elevation sheets showing window, door, or duct locations relative to transformer pads are included in the provided documentation. The 12-foot clearance requirement for oil-filled equipment cannot be verified.","agentTrace":{"observation":"Site plan shows transformer pad locations but no building elevation details identifying window, door, or ventilation duct locations and their lateral separation distances from transformers.","reasoning":"This requirement is conditional on presence of windows/doors/ducts with specific lateral separation and grade relationships. Without elevation details, applicability and compliance cannot be determined.","tools_used":[]}},{"deficiencyId":"EL-13.7","status":"not-verifiable","codeCitations":["UCM § 1.10.4 Table 1.10.4"],"applicableAreas":["Transformer pad locations adjacent to sidewalks"],"sheetReferences":[{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNumber":21},{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNumber":9}],"documentReferences":[],"comment":"Sidewalks are shown on site plan but measured distances from transformer pads to back of sidewalk are not provided, preventing verification of minimum 2-foot clearance.","agentTrace":{"observation":"Sidewalks are depicted on Sheets 9 and 21. Transformer pad locations are shown on Sheet 21. No dimension lines or distance callouts connect transformer pads to sidewalk back edges.","reasoning":"While sidewalks exist on site, the specific clearance distance from each transformer pad to sidewalk is not documented with dimensions or callouts, making compliance verification impossible.","tools_used":["vision_check"]}},{"deficiencyId":"EL-13.8","status":"n/a","codeCitations":["Reviewer Convention"],"applicableAreas":[],"sheetReferences":[],"documentReferences":[],"comment":"No stairwells serving as fire exits are depicted on site plan near transformer pad locations.","agentTrace":{"observation":"Sheets 9 and 21 show site layout with buildings and site features. No stairwell structures adjacent to transformer pads are identified.","reasoning":"The triggering condition (stairwells adjacent to transformer) is not present on the plans. Requirement does not apply to this site.","tools_used":[]}},{"deficiencyId":"EL-13.9","status":"n/a","codeCitations":["UCM § 1.10.4 Table 1.10.4"],"applicableAreas":[],"sheetReferences":[],"documentReferences":[],"comment":"No fire escapes or exterior stairs serving as fire exits are shown on fire protection plan or building elevations.","agentTrace":{"observation":"Sheet 10 (Fire Protection Plan) shows fire lanes and hydrant locations but no fire escape structures. Elevations were not reviewed but no fire escape references appear in plan notes.","reasoning":"Fire escapes triggering the 20-foot clearance requirement are not identified on the site. Requirement is not applicable.","tools_used":[]}},{"deficiencyId":"EL-13.10","status":"not-verifiable","codeCitations":["UCM § 1.10.4 Table 1.10.4"],"applicableAreas":["All transformer pad locations on site"],"sheetReferences":[{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNumber":21}],"documentReferences":[],"comment":"Transformer pad access door orientation and hot-stick use area clearances to open space and adjacent structures are not identified or dimensioned on the electrical plan. Cannot verify minimum 10-foot clearance.","agentTrace":{"observation":"Vision analysis of Sheet 21 reveals 5 transformer pads shown as basic rectangular outlines. Access door orientation is not explicitly labeled, and no clearance zones or distance dimensions are provided.","reasoning":"Although transformer pads are located, the access door side is not identified, and clearance distances are not dimensioned. This is a fundamental documentation gap preventing compliance verification.","tools_used":["vision_check"]}},{"deficiencyId":"EL-13.11","status":"not-verifiable","codeCitations":["UCM § 1.10.4 Table 1.10.4"],"applicableAreas":["Transformer pad locations if facing confined space"],"sheetReferences":[{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNumber":21}],"documentReferences":[],"comment":"No transformer pad is identified as being located in a niche, vault, or confined space. If any pad is in such a configuration, the 15-foot clearance requirement and supporting cross-section documentation cannot be verified.","agentTrace":{"observation":"Sheet 21 shows transformer pads at grade level adjacent to open areas. No notes or markings indicate any transformer in a confined space or niche configuration.","reasoning":"The triggering condition (confined space configuration) is not documented. If transformers are in niches or confined spaces, this was not disclosed in the plan set submitted.","tools_used":["vision_check"]}},{"deficiencyId":"EL-13.12","status":"not-verifiable","codeCitations":["Reviewer Convention"],"applicableAreas":["Transformer pad locations near fire hydrants"],"sheetReferences":[{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNumber":10},{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNumber":21}],"documentReferences":[],"comment":"Fire protection plan shows 1 private fire hydrant on site. Clearance distance from this hydrant to transformer pads is not dimensioned, preventing verification of minimum 5-foot clearance.","agentTrace":{"observation":"Sheet 10 shows one private fire hydrant location. Sheet 21 shows transformer pad locations. No dimension lines or distance callouts connect the hydrant to any transformer pad.","reasoning":"While a fire hydrant exists on site (applicability condition met), measured distance from the hydrant to each transformer pad is not provided, making compliance verification impossible.","tools_used":["vision_check"]}},{"deficiencyId":"EL-13.13","status":"not-verifiable","codeCitations":["UCM § 1.10.10.4; ECM Appendix F"],"applicableAreas":["Transformer pad locations where trees are within 10 lateral feet"],"sheetReferences":[{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNumber":31}],"documentReferences":[],"comment":"Transformer pad locations are not depicted on landscape plan (Sheet 31), preventing verification of tree species utility-compatibility for trees within 10 feet of pads or 15 feet of overhead distribution lines.","agentTrace":{"observation":"Landscape plan (Sheet 31) shows trees and vegetation symbols but does not include transformer pad location overlays. Transformer pad locations from Sheet 21 cannot be cross-referenced with tree locations.","reasoning":"Without transformer pads depicted on the landscape plan, proximity relationships between trees and transformer equipment cannot be assessed. Tree species identification and utility-compatibility certification cannot be verified.","tools_used":["vision_check"]}},{"deficiencyId":"EL-13.14","status":"not-verifiable","codeCitations":["UCM § 1.10.10.4"],"applicableAreas":["Transformer pad locations adjacent to landscaping"],"sheetReferences":[{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNumber":21},{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNumber":31}],"documentReferences":[],"comment":"Transformer pad access door orientation is not identified on any plan. Shrub and low-lying vegetation clearance requirements (10 feet from access door, 5 feet from other sides) cannot be verified without transformer pad details showing door location.","agentTrace":{"observation":"Sheet 31 shows landscaping details but transformers are not overlaid for proximity comparison. Sheet 21 shows transformers without access door orientation markings.","reasoning":"Access door orientation is fundamental to applying the different clearance requirements (10 feet vs. 5 feet). Without this designation, compliance cannot be assessed.","tools_used":[]}},{"deficiencyId":"EL-13.15","status":"not-verifiable","codeCitations":["UCM § 1.10.10.4"],"applicableAreas":["Trees within 20 lateral feet of underground electric equipment"],"sheetReferences":[{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNumber":31}],"documentReferences":[],"comment":"Transformer pad locations are not shown on landscape plan. Root barrier specifications (4 feet deep, 5 feet from equipment) cannot be verified for trees within 20 feet of transformer locations.","agentTrace":{"observation":"Landscape plan (Sheet 31) contains no root barrier details or transformer pad location references. Tree proximity to underground transformer equipment cannot be determined.","reasoning":"Without transformer locations overlaid on the landscape plan or root barrier callouts on detail sheets, this requirement cannot be verified.","tools_used":["vision_check"]}},{"deficiencyId":"EL-13.16","status":"n/a","codeCitations":["Reviewer Convention"],"applicableAreas":[],"sheetReferences":[],"documentReferences":[],"comment":"No dumpsters or trash enclosures are shown adjacent to transformer pad locations.","agentTrace":{"observation":"Site plans (Sheets 9 and 21) show building layouts and utilities. No dumpster or trash receptacle symbols are identified near transformer pads.","reasoning":"The triggering condition (dumpster proximity) is not present on the plans. Requirement does not apply.","tools_used":[]}},{"deficiencyId":"EL-13.17","status":"n/a","codeCitations":["Reviewer Convention"],"applicableAreas":[],"sheetReferences":[],"documentReferences":[],"comment":"Bicycle racks are shown on site plan but not adjacent to transformer pad locations.","agentTrace":{"observation":"Sheets 9 and 31 identify bicycle parking locations (long-term and short-term). These are not positioned near any transformer pad.","reasoning":"Bike racks exist on site but not within triggering proximity to transformers. Requirement does not apply.","tools_used":[]}},{"deficiencyId":"EL-13.18","status":"not-verifiable","codeCitations":["Reviewer Convention"],"applicableAreas":["Transformer pad locations where light poles may be adjacent"],"sheetReferences":[{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNumber":21}],"documentReferences":[],"comment":"Light pole locations relative to transformer pads are not documented or dimensioned on the electrical or site plans.","agentTrace":{"observation":"Sheet 9 references exterior lighting and Figure 34 showing fixture types, but specific light pole locations and distances from transformer pads are not provided.","reasoning":"Without light pole location callouts on the electrical plan or site plan, proximity to transformers cannot be verified.","tools_used":[]}},{"deficiencyId":"EL-13.19","status":"not-verifiable","codeCitations":["Reviewer Convention"],"applicableAreas":["Transformer pad locations near fire lanes"],"sheetReferences":[{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNumber":10},{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNumber":21}],"documentReferences":[],"comment":"Fire protection plan (Sheet 10) shows fire lanes, but measured distance from fire lane centerline or striping to transformer pads on Sheet 21 is not dimensioned.","agentTrace":{"observation":"Sheet 10 depicts fire lanes with red curb striping and signage notes. Sheet 21 shows transformer locations. No dimension lines or callouts measure distance between fire lanes and transformers.","reasoning":"While fire lanes are clearly defined on the site, the specific clearance distance from each transformer to fire lane boundaries is not documented, preventing compliance verification.","tools_used":["vision_check"]}},{"deficiencyId":"EL-13.20","status":"not-verifiable","codeCitations":["Reviewer Convention"],"applicableAreas":["Spacing between multiple transformer pads on site"],"sheetReferences":[{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNumber":21}],"documentReferences":[],"comment":"Five transformer pads are shown on electrical plan but no dimensions or callouts indicate the distances between individual pads. Minimum 5-foot separation cannot be verified.","agentTrace":{"observation":"Sheet 21 depicts 5 transformer pads in different locations. No dimension lines connect pads to show inter-pad spacing.","reasoning":"Multiple transformers are shown (applicability condition met), but clearance between them is not documented. Compliance cannot be verified without dimensions.","tools_used":["vision_check"]}},{"deficiencyId":"EL-13.21","status":"not-verifiable","codeCitations":["UCM § 2.9.1.B.2"],"applicableAreas":["All transformer pad locations"],"sheetReferences":[{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNumber":19},{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNumber":21}],"documentReferences":[],"comment":"Water utility lines are shown on utility tap plan (Sheet 19) but no overlay on electrical plan (Sheet 21) or dimension callouts verify the 5-foot minimum horizontal clearance between transformer pads and water service lines.","agentTrace":{"observation":"Sheet 19 depicts water line routing. Sheet 21 shows transformer locations. The two documents are not spatially coordinated with dimension lines showing distance between water lines and transformers.","reasoning":"While utilities are shown on different sheets, no cross-referenced dimensions or clearance callouts on a single integrated utility plan demonstrate the required 5-foot separation.","tools_used":[]}},{"deficiencyId":"EL-13.22","status":"not-verifiable","codeCitations":["UCM § 2.9.1.B.2"],"applicableAreas":["All transformer pad locations"],"sheetReferences":[{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNumber":19},{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNumber":21}],"documentReferences":[],"comment":"Wastewater service lines are shown on utility tap plan (Sheet 19) but clearance distance from transformer pads is not dimensioned or verified on an integrated utility plan.","agentTrace":{"observation":"Sheet 19 shows wastewater service routing at 6-inch PVC. Sheet 21 shows transformer pads. No coordinated dimension lines between the two sheets indicate separation distances.","reasoning":"Utilities are documented on separate sheets without integrated spatial verification of the 5-foot minimum clearance requirement.","tools_used":[]}},{"deficiencyId":"EL-13.23","status":"not-verifiable","codeCitations":["UCM § 2.9.1.B.2"],"applicableAreas":["All transformer pad locations"],"sheetReferences":[{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNumber":12},{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNumber":21}],"documentReferences":[],"comment":"Storm drain infrastructure is shown on storm sewer plan (Sheet 12) but no overlay or dimension callouts verify minimum 5-foot clearance between transformer pads and storm lines.","agentTrace":{"observation":"Storm drain layout is depicted on Sheet 12. Transformer locations are on Sheet 21. The two documents are not coordinated with dimension lines showing transformer-to-storm-drain distances.","reasoning":"Separate utility systems are documented on separate sheets. Without integrated spatial coordination, clearance compliance cannot be verified.","tools_used":[]}},{"deficiencyId":"EL-13.24","status":"n/a","codeCitations":["UCM § 1.10.5.A"],"applicableAreas":[],"sheetReferences":[],"documentReferences":[],"comment":"No gas service infrastructure is shown on the utility plans.","agentTrace":{"observation":"Utility tap plan (Sheet 19) and grading plan (Sheet 11) depict water, wastewater, storm drain, and electric utilities. No gas lines or meters are identified.","reasoning":"Gas infrastructure is not present on the site. Requirement does not apply.","tools_used":[]}},{"deficiencyId":"EL-13.25","status":"not-verifiable","codeCitations":["UCM § 1.10.5.A"],"applicableAreas":["All transformer pad locations"],"sheetReferences":[{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNumber":19},{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNumber":21}],"documentReferences":[],"comment":"No cross-referenced dimensions on utility sheets verify the minimum 12-inch horizontal and vertical clearance from transformer pads to underground utilities (conduits, communication cables, etc.).","agentTrace":{"observation":"Utilities are shown on separate sheets (19, 21) with no coordinated dimension callouts indicating 12-inch minimum separations.","reasoning":"Without integrated utility coordination drawings or dimension callouts showing 12-inch clearances, compliance cannot be verified.","tools_used":[]}},{"deficiencyId":"EL-13.26","status":"not-verifiable","codeCitations":["UCM § 1.10.5.B"],"applicableAreas":["All transformer pad locations"],"sheetReferences":[{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNumber":21}],"documentReferences":[],"comment":"No utility coordination drawing, conflict analysis, or cross-section details verify that transformer pads are not located over/under other utility lines or that customer structures are not installed over AE underground facilities.","agentTrace":{"observation":"Sheet 21 shows transformers and utilities on plan view without vertical cross-sections or utility conflict callouts.","reasoning":"Three-dimensional utility relationships require cross-section drawings or explicit coordination notes. Neither is provided.","tools_used":[]}},{"deficiencyId":"EL-13.27","status":"not-verifiable","codeCitations":["UCM § 1.10.3"],"applicableAreas":["Transformer pad locations where overhead distribution lines are present"],"sheetReferences":[{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNumber":21},{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNumber":31}],"documentReferences":[],"comment":"Overhead electric (OHE) lines are indicated on plans (shown as dashed lines), but no cross-section drawings or dimension callouts document the 7.5-foot minimum horizontal sky-to-ground clearance from transformer pads to overhead distribution conductors.","agentTrace":{"observation":"Overhead electric lines are depicted on Sheets 21 and 31. No cross-section views or vertical clearance annotations are provided.","reasoning":"