{"level":30,"time":1778246545601,"pid":122,"hostname":"4de9b0d3-b46","step":"review-runs","item":"2.md","index":7,"runIndex":"run-3","type":"assistant","message":{"id":"gen_01KR3W1NYYH9BEJWYF3C7VDPYW","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Good! I've completed the structured output with all 15 checklist items evaluated. Let me verify I've covered everything:\n\nChecklist Items Evaluated:\n1. EL-2.1 - NOT-VERIFIABLE ✓\n2. EL-2.2 - N/A ✓\n3. EL-2.3 - NOT-VERIFIABLE ✓\n4. EL-2.4 - N/A ✓\n5. EL-2.5 - N/A ✓\n6. EL-2.6 - NOT-VERIFIABLE ✓\n7. EL-2.7 - NOT-VERIFIABLE ✓\n8. EL-2.8 - NOT-VERIFIABLE ✓\n9. EL-2.9 - NOT-VERIFIABLE ✓\n10. EL-2.10 - FAIL ✓\n11. EL-2.11 - FAIL ✓\n12. EL-2.12 - NOT-VERIFIABLE ✓\n13. EL-2.13 - NOT-VERIFIABLE ✓\n14. EL-2.14 - FAIL ✓\n15. EL-2.15 - NOT-VERIFIABLE ✓\n\nKey Findings:\n- FAIL items: EL-2.10 (plant legend missing species identification), EL-2.11 (large trees not differentiated by height), EL-2.14 (insufficient relationship documentation between trees and overhead facilities)\n- NOT-VERIFIABLE items: All items related to clearance distances (EL-2.1, EL-2.3, EL-2.6, EL-2.7, EL-2.8, EL-2.9, EL-2.12, EL-2.13, EL-2.15) because clearance dimensions are not provided on the landscape plan\n\n\n- N/A items: Transmission-related requirements (EL-2.2, EL-2.4, EL-2.5) since no transmission facilities or easements exist on the site.\n\nThe fundamental gaps preventing compliance verification are: species identification missing from the plant legend, mature heights not specified for trees, and no clearance measurements shown between vegetation and utility infrastructure. These omissions make it impossible to assess distance-based requirements.","signature":""}],"model":"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001","stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":0},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"8bd4df49-5a3c-4afa-8eeb-b16b6883780f","uuid":"71c51d82-2963-4639-be0a-e