{"level":30,"time":1778246937806,"pid":122,"hostname":"4de9b0d3-b46","step":"synthesize-comments","item":"13.json","index":2,"runIndex":"run-1","type":"assistant","message":{"id":"gen_01KR3WDFAMD11ZNQYGBN8KB5YM","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I've successfully synthesized the **34 transformer pad placement and clearance findings** into **9 consolidated review comments**, achieving a **3.78:1 consolidation ratio** (target ~4:1).\n\n## Summary of Consolidation\n\n| Comment | Theme | Findings | Severity |\n|---------|-------|----------|----------|\n| 1 | Easement compliance & property placement | 4 | High (3) |\n| 2 | Building/structure clearances | 7 | Medium (2) |\n| 3 | Access door orientation & spacing | 3 | Medium (2) |\n| 4 | Vegetation/landscape coordination | 3 | Medium (2) |\n| 5 | Underground utility separation | 5 | Medium (2) |\n| 6 | Overhead distribution clearances | 3 | Medium (2) |\n| 7 | Transformer pad design & bollards | 2 | Medium (2) |\n| 8 | Fire protection coordination | 2 | Low (1) |\n| 9 | Vertical clearances & special conditions | 5 | Low-Medium (1-2) |\n\n**All 34 input findings are accounted for.** Each finding appears exactly once in the output via its `sourceId` in one comment's details array. No information was dropped — all code citations, measurements, locations, and per-run comments are preserved verbatim.\n\nThe output is a flat JSON array of 9 standalone comments ready for downstream review workflow processing. Each comment includes:\n- Clear headline and summary\n- Relevant sheet numbers\n- Canonical applicable area\n- Severity and confidence ratings\n- Cross-department coordination notes\n- Verification flags for ambiguities or low-confidence findings\n- Per-checklist-item details with full run history for auditing"}],"model":"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001","stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":0},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"ses